    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Lifter</i>, you step into the shoes of a cunning yet kind-hearted thief trying to save their home from the brink of eviction. Set in a sprawling world teeming with secrets, this Adventure RPG weaves a tale of desperation, cleverness, and moral choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every job presents unique challenges, requiring a mix of stealth, agility, and wit. Unlock gadgets and skills to outsmart store employees, disable security, and disappear into the shadows. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As time ticks down toward your eviction date, the pressure mounts. Will you pay off your debts honorably, or will your actions create consequences you can\u2019t outrun? In <i>Lifter</i>, survival isn't just about what you steal\u2014it's about what you stand for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Heist Mechanics:</strong> Plan and execute heists using a mix of stealth, strategy, and environmental puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moral Choices:</strong> Decide who to rob and how far you're willing to go, with your decisions shaping the city and your character's story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich World-Building:</strong> Explore a vibrant world filled with colorful NPCs, hidden paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Playstyle:</strong> Upgrade your  tools to match your unique approach to thievery.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you become the legend who stole back their future, or will the world swallow you whole? The choice is yours in <i>Lifter</i>.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Lifter</i>, you step into the shoes of a cunning yet kind-hearted thief trying to save their home from the brink of eviction. Set in a sprawling world teeming with secrets, this Adventure RPG weaves a tale of desperation, cleverness, and moral choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every job presents unique challenges, requiring a mix of stealth, agility, and wit. Unlock gadgets and skills to outsmart store employees, disable security, and disappear into the shadows. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As time ticks down toward your eviction date, the pressure mounts. Will you pay off your debts honorably, or will your actions create consequences you can\u2019t outrun? In <i>Lifter</i>, survival isn't just about what you steal\u2014it's about what you stand for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Heist Mechanics:</strong> Plan and execute heists using a mix of stealth, strategy, and environmental puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moral Choices:</strong> Decide who to rob and how far you're willing to go, with your decisions shaping the city and your character's story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich World-Building:</strong> Explore a vibrant world filled with colorful NPCs, hidden paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Playstyle:</strong> Upgrade your  tools to match your unique approach to thievery.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you become the legend who stole back their future, or will the world swallow you whole? The choice is yours in <i>Lifter</i>.</p>",
    "short_description": "Lifter is an Adventure RPG where you play as a desperate thief trying to save your home from eviction. Outsmart employees, and decide who to steal from in a world full of secrets. Will you be a hero, a rogue, or something in between? The future is in your hands.",
